{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Cadenza \u2014 a\u00a0<strong>stylized,  synthwave cityscape</strong>\u00a0\u2014 and fight to escape its limits alongside <strong>K8E</strong>: a mysterious persona-sword belonging to the oppressive Camerata. Tear across highway roads with her bike form, and leap into battle with her sword form. The Camerata want <strong>K8E</strong> back, and will stop at nothing to reclaim their property.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world without song is a world without soul; don't let them take hers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/250d0b93ebb5af476d656b7cfc21ef03.avif?t=1753455715\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your best weapon is the bodies of those who stand against you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/d80cbd03f1a0a5f8e3625f95d50345ea.poster.avif?t=1753455715\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/d80cbd03f1a0a5f8e3625f95d50345ea.webp?t=1753455715\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dunk</strong> your enemies: <strong>turn them</strong>\u00a0<strong>into projectiles</strong>, and carve a path of fractured asphalt through the hordes in <strong>fast-paced, power-tripping combat</strong>. <br><br><strong>The Dissonant Five</strong> are the only thing standing between you and the path to freedom; <strong>silence their voices</strong> and make your escape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/b72047dff38d3d6d09fe95cf53f16fb3.avif?t=1753455715\" data-has-big /></div>Drive, drift, jump, and boost on a <strong>nimble and responsive</strong> physics-based <strong>motorcycle</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/547f8d155023908dff8f6cdc409eb4ac.poster.avif?t=1753455715\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/547f8d155023908dff8f6cdc409eb4ac.webp?t=1753455715\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chat with K8E</strong> in-between combat encounters. Get to know your mysterious vehicle-companion, and learn the circumstances of both her capture and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/21eeb13b121c62c42a4b1695bb55a3ea.avif?t=1753455715\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the dust settles, morph K8E into her bike form and set off towards your next target.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/96332ffb93bdc06eb54699456deb40d3.poster.avif?t=1753455715\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/extras/96332ffb93bdc06eb54699456deb40d3.webp?t=1753455715\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>The Camerata will increase their security as you and <strong>K8E</strong> bring down more of <strong>the Dissonant Five</strong>, but it won't matter; together, you've got this.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power-tripping dunking system: launch cars, explosives, and dudes at other dudes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a friendship with K8E the talking, transforming motorcycle-gauntlet-sword</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responsive, fluid, physics-based motorcycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 unique boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized 80's synthwave retro-futuristic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic synthwave soundscape</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651550?t=1753455715","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651550?t=1753455715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/206efe09fc02db86b94fd01836af5a91df325cab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753455715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651550/206efe09fc02db86b94fd01836af5a91df325cab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753455715","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Cadenza \u2014 a\u00a0<strong>stylized,  synthwave cityscape</strong>\u00a0\u2014 and fight to escape its limits alongside <strong>K8E</strong>: a mysterious persona-sword belonging to the oppressive Camerata. Tear across highway roads with her bike form, and leap into battle with her sword form. The Camerata want <strong>K8E</strong> back, and will stop at nothing to reclaim their property.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world without song is a world without soul; don't let them take hers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag